+      <div class="two-column auth-columns"><div><p class="measure-prose">API 使用 <strong>Bearer Token</strong> 进行身份验证。每次请求时，请在 HTTP 请求头中携带访问令牌。</p><div class="header-format"><span>请求头</span><code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;YOUR_API_TOKEN&gt;</code></div><div class="note"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 8 4v6c0 4-8 8-8 8s-8-4-8-8V7z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg><div><strong>妥善保管你的 Token</strong><p>请通过服务端环境变量保存令牌，避免将其暴露在浏览器代码或公开仓库中。</p></div></div><p class="small-description">示例以已签发的 Token 为前提；缺失、无效或过期的令牌将返回 <code>401 Unauthorized</code>。</p></div><div class="code-panel"><div class="code-toolbar"><span><span class="terminal-icon">⌘</span> 鉴权请求示例</span><button class="copy code-copy" data-target="auth-code">复制 <span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span></button></div><pre id="auth-code"><code><span class="syntax-purple">curl</span> --request GET \
