</span></button></div><pre id="request-${e.id}"><code>${escapeHTML(requestCode(e,'curl'))}</code></pre></div><div class="code-panel response-panel"><div class="code-toolbar"><span>响应示例</span><span class="success-status"><span class="status-dot"></span>${e.status}</span><button class="copy code-copy" data-target="response-${e.id}" aria-label="复制${e.title}响应">⧉</button></div><pre id="response-${e.id}"><code>${highlight(e.response)}</code></pre></div></div></div></section>`).join('');
